@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@dataset = REEMPLAZAR_UUID_ESTUDIO
@import = REEMPLAZAR_UUID_IMPORTACION
@sheet = REEMPLAZAR_UUID_HOJA
@validation = REEMPLAZAR_UUID_VALIDACION

### Login (usar la cuenta creada con app:create-admin)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.test","password":"REEMPLAZAR_CONTRASENA"}

### Crear estudio
POST {{base}}/datasets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Seguimiento titulados 2026","reference_period":"2026"}

### Catálogo de preguntas y códigos
GET {{base}}/catalog?survey_type=titulados
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Subir CSV sintético de dos preguntas (requiere permiso de contactos)
POST {{base}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=umss-example

--umss-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dataset_id"

{{dataset}}
--umss-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="csv_delimiter"

,
--umss-example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ejemplo.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Estudio,Trabajo
Sí,No
No,Sí
--umss-example--

### Configurar hoja (usar import y sheet devueltos al subir)
PUT {{base}}/imports/{{import}}/sheets/{{sheet}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_configuration_revision":1,"selected":true,"survey_type":"titulados","dictionary_version":"umss-hibrido-v1","header_row":1,"data_region":{"first_data_row":2,"last_data_row":null,"first_column_index":0,"last_column_index":1},"columns":[{"column_index":0,"role":"field","field_id":"T03"},{"column_index":1,"role":"field","field_id":"T08"}],"multiselect_rules":[]}

### Validar
POST {{base}}/imports/{{import}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_configuration_revision":2}

### Consultar incidencias de esa validación
GET {{base}}/imports/{{import}}/issues?validation_run_id={{validation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Incorporar (generar UUID nuevo por confirmación; conservarlo al reintentar)
POST {{base}}/imports/{{import}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 4f4ca9cd-585a-4c31-b22e-1ec04bc10c5a
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"configuration_revision":2,"validation_run_id":"{{validation}}","policy":{"mode":"append"}}

### Distribución
GET {{base}}/datasets/{{dataset}}/analytics/distribution?survey_type=titulados&field_id=T08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Exportar estadísticas de la versión visualizada
POST {{base}}/datasets/{{dataset}}/exports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_data_version":1,"format":"xlsx","kind":"distribution","survey_type":"titulados","field_id":"T08","filters":[]}

### Crear invitación individual (token distinto al administrativo)
POST {{base}}/datasets/{{dataset}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"expires_in_hours":48}
